THIRD PARTY DATA

The playing and coaching career records and the match results in data/source are
derived from publicly visible pages on www.transfermarkt.com. The terms above
cover the authors' compilation, cleaning, coding and pseudonymisation of that
material. They do not and cannot grant rights in the underlying source data,
which remains subject to whatever terms its original publisher applies. Users
who intend to redistribute the source data, as opposed to using it to reproduce
the results in the paper, should satisfy themselves as to those terms.

The race codings are derived from a picture survey run by the authors. Only
aggregated vote shares and majority classifications are distributed. Individual
respondent identities are not included.


PSEUDONYMISATION

Player, coach and club names, profile URLs and exact dates of birth have been
replaced by stable pseudonyms. Only the year of birth is retained. This removes
direct identifiers, but it is pseudonymisation rather than anonymisation. Match
results are public record, so a determined party with access to the original
sources could in principle re-identify clubs from fixture sequences, and coaches
from spell dates at those clubs. Users should not attempt re-identification.
